  "title": "Logistic Properties of the Americas Announces Full-Year 2025 Earnings Results",
  "summary": "Company Accelerates Growth, Reflected in Revenue Increase of 23.3% in 4Q25 and 14.3% in 2025 NOI Increases 29.8% in 4Q25 and 11.9% for the Year SAN JOSÉ, Costa Rica, March 18, 2026 – Logistic Properties of the Americas (NYSE American: LPA) (together with its subsidiaries, “LPA” or “the Company”), announced today its audited consolidated financial results for the year ended December 31, 2025 (“FY25”). The financial results are expressed in U.S. dollars and are presented in accordance with International Financial […]",
